  "class_declaration": "# Each object is the whole 3x3 block that fills the grid. The output sets its left-right mirror image beside it, on the right\nclass Obj(x: int, y: int, width: int, height: int, orientation: int, volume: int, tag: str = 'l9100'):\n    this.x is x\n    this.y is y\n    this.width is width\n    this.height is height\n    this.orientation is orientation\n    this.volume is volume\n    this.tag is tag",
